!design-preview/mobile-v25-430.png
!design-preview/COMPARE-v24-v25.png
!design-preview/hit-validation.json
!design-preview/hit-validation.md
# 排除历史版本 (体积 + 不再迭代)
design-preview/_assets-*/
design-preview/__pycache__/

# generated/ 素材生成工作区 — 仅批次溯源 (asset-plan) 与已定稿产物入库, 被淘汰的候选轮次留在本地不入库
generated/far-view-candidates/
generated/qualified-candidates/
generated/candidates/

